      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ACCREDITED (1) ran below best last time finishing fifth (34.82) over 595m at Sandown from Box 3. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Tough to beat if on-song. GIACOMO (8) should get a clear run from the wide draw. Safely held last start when a 8 length 6th at Healesville (19.64). Goes very well at course and distance boasting two wins. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Should be about the money. SCOTT GNARLY (2) could manage only second at this track last time but turned heads when posting an enormous 22.11 over 390m at Shepparton three starts ago. Should be in this for a long way. RITZA OLD MATE (7) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
